{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pulls/513","id":4602286017,"node_id":"PR_kwDOP42Xbc8AAAABElFPwQ","html_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pull/513","diff_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pull/513.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pull/513.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/513","number":513,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Repair and run the AEM store generator self-test in CI","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[A10] The AEM store self-test failed on the deployed one-map model and was absent from CI. This change repairs its fixtures and cause-specific refusals, then adds the self-test to the pinned documentation workflow.\n\n## Contents\n\n- [Status](#status)\n- [Linked Issue / roles](#linked-issue--roles)\n- [Description](#description)\n- [Authoritative references](#authoritative-references)\n- [How to get into the same state](#how-to-get-into-the-same-state)\n- [How to validate](#how-to-validate)\n- [Known limitations / out of scope](#known-limitations--out-of-scope)\n- [Definition of Done](#definition-of-done)\n\n## Status\n\nHead `a769d9dbc937fb324c4726e60dee5b2f7ad349e3`, tree `31ddc6b5615ff91ceed7a6b52afca61c5fb9653d`, `464-aem-store-selftest` -> `dev`. The complete 41-command static/builder bank and five native groups pass on this exact object. It merges author head `1576f0893ae9781074fffb105f5384fe774ff11e` with dev `88e9276b2a220c716f64a843f7e1eb8f9265e896`, preserving the complete issue patch. Trusted act, hosted checks and independent reviews are pending. Public evidence is in the validation comment.\n\n## Linked Issue / roles\n\nCloses #464\nRelates to #407, #495 and #509\n\nExecutor: A167 (Opus); manager: A10. Cleared-context internal reviewer: R235 (Opus); external reviewer: R236 (Codex).\n\n## Description\n\nThe self-test still indexed a second map after the deployed model changed to one map. Its new explicit fixture supplies valid input/output map geometry, and each negative vector must fail for its own bound. The six recorded deployed deviations retain their exact mapping values and are reindexed to AUDIO_MAP[0]. Python 3.12 also needs the missing `Callable` import.\n\nThe retained self-test has 20 arms, including fixture acceptance. All prior refusal, directory and format controls remain. The documentation carrier gains a pinned self-test step, with matching `ci_events.py` ownership and documentation. No production validator is widened.\n\nThe PP (protocol processor) serves the guarded descriptor image. Author comparison of all five shipping configurations found 83 generated product files byte-identical to the base. That evidence belongs to author head 1576f089; the later integration changes only the disjoint #507 Markdown tooling. Processor pins remain unchanged.\n\n## Authoritative references\n\n- [Issue scope and readiness](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/464#issuecomment-5770832953), [author assignment](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/464#issuecomment-5774939905), and [exact candidate publication decision](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/464#issuecomment-5776427479).\n- REQUIREMENTS REQ-VER-03/04; IEEE 1722.1-2021 sections 7.2.13, 7.2.16 and 7.2.19; Milan v1.2 sections 5.3.3.9 and 6.4, as cited by `avdecc/aem_maps.py`.\n- `docs/testing/CI_WORKFLOWS.md`, including the #407 carrier-script pin contract.\n\n## How to get into the same state\n\n```sh\ngit fetch origin 464-aem-store-selftest dev\ngit checkout a769d9dbc937fb324c4726e60dee5b2f7ad349e3\ngit submodule update --init third_party/verilog-axis protocol-processor gptp-processor\n```\n\nUse the documented toolchain and dependencies in `docs/testing/RUNNING_TESTS.md`.\n\n## How to validate\n\n```sh\npython3 avdecc/gen_aem_store.py --self-test\npython3 scripts/ci_events.py --check\npython3 scripts/ci_events.py --selftest\npython3 scripts/check_py_idiom.py\npython3 scripts/check_em_dash.py --base 88e9276b2a220c716f64a843f7e1eb8f9265e896\npython3 scripts/docs_check.py\npython3 scripts/check_doc_paths.py\npython3 scripts/gen_toc.py --check\npython3 sw/builder/test_builder.py\n```\n\nExpected: 20 self-test arms pass; cause-specific refusals remain named; CI policy accepts the added pinned step and refuses its planted rewrites; documentation and idiom gates pass. The complete commands, native results and original/corrected mutation controls are linked in the evidence comment. Builder calibration gate 11 remains NOT RUN without its physical report.\n\n## Known limitations / out of scope\n\nThe fixture's static input map tests a supported generator shape rather than the shipping dynamic input map. Changing a refusal message requires updating its fail-closed expectation. The pre-existing unused `avdecc/aem_rom.json` drift is tracked on #495; #509 retains descriptor-ownership decisions. No physical, bitstream, four-state or timing evidence is claimed. Four optional field-campaign skips contribute zero checks.\n\n## Definition of Done\n\n- [x] Scoped implementation and focused failure-sensitive controls are complete.\n- [x] Full local bar passes on the exact current-candidate object.\n- [x] Documentation reflects the changed self-test and CI step.\n- [ ] Trusted act and required hosted contexts pass at the final head.\n- [ ] Two independent positive reviews and reviewer-owned clean five-lens coverage.\n- [ ] No open blocking/minor finding or review round remains.\n- [ ] Validate against then-current dev and verify the actual merge result.\n- [ ] Post-merge containment, hosted checks, Issue closure and Project Done.\n","created_at":"2026-09-22T12:51:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T13:11:09Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e8e3f66527b3bbc93f3a72b7bcedbb968e4886fc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pulls/513/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pulls/513/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/513/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/statuses/a769d9dbc937fb324c4726e60dee5b2f7ad349e3","head":{"label":"kebag-logic:464-aem-store-selftest","ref":"464-aem-store-selftest","sha":"a769d9dbc937fb324c4726e60dee5b2f7ad349e3","user":{"login":"kebag-logic","id":142733852,"node_id":"O_kgDOCIHyHA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142733852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic","html_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url"